		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Two Checks, One Quota Hit\n\n**Check Format** runs offline and filters out typos without spending quota. Only the numbers that pass reach **Validate**, which does the live VIES lookup.\n\nAdd a **Vatnode API** credential to the Validate node before you run this. Get a key at [vatnode.dev/dashboard/api-keys](https://vatnode.dev/dashboard/api-keys) — the free plan needs no card.\n\nSet a Requester VAT under Account details in the vatnode dashboard, and every result carries a `consultationNumber` — the evidence a tax auditor asks for.",
				"height": 320,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
			"name": "Read me",
